  "releaseNotes": "--JAN 2026: Initial .NET 10 release.\n\t  --APR 2026: Updated to BenchmarkDotNet 0.15.8 and added Windows Diagnostics support and BenchmarkHelper.\n\t  --MAY 2026: Added MemoryDiagnoser/ThreadingDiagnoser and diagnoser categories, filePrefix support for BenchmarkHelper.RunBenchmarks, CancellationToken support, and optimized allocations/logging in the Benchmark base class.\n\t  --JUN 2026: Code cleanup and refactoring, including collection expressions in DirectoryHelper.\n\t  --JUL 2026: Expanded benchmark coverage for all extension methods, added random data properties, and refactored platform attributes.\n\t  --AUG 2026: Added comprehensive benchmarks (including ThreadPoolHelper), parameterized runs, diagnostics and metadata enhancements, and refactored TempFileManager to use ConcurrentDictionary.\n\t  --OCT 2026: Updated OpenTelemetry.Api to 1.18.0, refreshed [Information] attributes and file headers, and fixed folder casing.",
